Subject: [PATCH] Buy Now goes straight to the checkout form

Every Buy Now button (shop, product page, homepage cards) adds the item and
opens checkout instead of the cart page.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HALAYuw82s3VFw2zbyoURm
